            <div xml:id="d538">

                <pb facs="0985" n="971" xml:id="pg971"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">800.42/482: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in the United
                        Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Winant</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-04-17T00:00:00-04:00">April 17,
                            1944—midnight</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3071. For Fulbright. We are pleased with good progress being made by delegation.
                    In order that draft plan for a United Nations organization for educational and
                    cultural reconstruction as outlined your 3124 of April 17 may receive careful
                    consideration here on all aspects and be discussed informally with interested
                    members of Congress, we would prefer not having plan formally approved and
                    submitted by Conference to United Nations for adherence until it has been
                    informally referred to interested governments for preliminary consideration,
                    comments and possible suggestions. We believe it essential for us to have an
                    opportunity to go over plan with you on your return here before it is formally
                    approved and submitted by Conference to this Government. Please make our
                    position on this clear to Conference members and observers. Please continue full
                    reports on developments and forward full text of proposed plan.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
